าพันธ์ 2569' becomes '06/02/2026')"}, "trade_date": {"type": "string", "description": "Identical to issue_date for Direct Listing (Direct Listing) SET DWs, representing the first day of exchange trading.2 Format as DD/MM/YYYY."}, "distributor": {"type": "string", "description": "Default to the identical value extracted for the 'issuer' parameter, as the issuer acts as its own direct listing distributor on the SET"}, "buffer_level": {"type": "string", "description": "Set strictly to null."}, "product_type": {"type": "string", "description": "Hardcode as 'Growth'"}, "document_type": {"type": "string", "description": "Hardcode as 'Final' to indicate these are finalized, non-draft pricing term sheets"}, "maturity_date": {"type": "number", "description": "Extract the maturity date ('วันครบกำหนดอายุ'). Format as YYYY-MM-DDTHH:MM:SSZ"}, "investment_type": {"type": "string", "description": "Hardcode as 'Warrant'"}, "offering_closes": {"type": "string", "description": "The date the subscription period ends. For direct market listings lacking a discrete subscription window, return null."}, "product_subtype": {"type": "string", "description": "Determine the option directionality. If the document states 'สิทธิในการซื้อ' (Right to buy), output 'Call Warrant'. If it states 'สิทธิในการขาย' (Right to sell), output 'Put Warrant'"}, "settlement_type": {"type": "string", "description": "Extract the settlement method. This should map from 'ชำระเงินตามส่วนต่างของราคา' to the English string 'Cash' or 'Cash Settlement'"}, "principal_amount": {"type": "number", "description": "Extract the absolute total offering value ('มูลค่ารวมที่เสนอขาย') without currency symbols (e.g., 40000000.00 for the ADVANC Put) beside this \\"จํานวนที่เสนอขาย\\". and give\\"*\\" and look for \\"อัตราการใช้สิทธิต่อหน่วย\\" get fraction like 0.67. the formate is 40000000*0.67"}, "global_identifier": {"type": "string", "description": "go to the \\"ชื่อของใบสำคัญแสดงสิทธิอนุพันธ\\" and find the english word suc as \\"BABA41C2610A\\" and return the field with this value"}, "underlying_ticker": {"type": "string", "description": "Identify the underlying asset ('หลักทรัพย์อ้างอิง'). Determine its standard SET symbol and append ' TB Equity' to format it as a valid Bloomberg ticker (e.g., 'COM7 TB Equity', 'CPF TB Equity')"}, "expiry_payment_date": {"type": "string", "description": "Mirror the maturity_date, as settlement occurs precisely upon expiration."}, "final_valuation_date": {"type": "number", "description": "Extract the last trading day ('วันทำการซื้อขายสุดท้าย'). Format as YYYY-MM-DDTHH:MM:SSZ"}, "trading_jurisdiction": {"type": "string", "description": "Extract the exchange locale. Hardcode as 'TH' (Thailand) based on the SET regulatory framework"}, "initial_valuation_date": {"type": ["string", "null"], "description": "Extract the date used to determine the initial reference price. If not explicitly isolated from the issue date, return null. date formate is YYYY-MM-DDTHH:MM:SSZ"}, "expiry_observation_date": {"type": "string", "description": "Mirror the final_valuation_date, as European DWs observe the underlying price strictly on the final trading day."}, "investment_or_leveraged": {"type": "string", "description": "Hardcode as 'Leveraged Product', indicating the derivative nature of the warrant"}, "proportional_principal_amount": {"type": "number", "description": "Set to null or a default integer if required by the legacy schema (e.g., 1 or 10)"}, "leveraged_product_exercise_style": {"type": "string", "description": "Extract the exercise architecture. Expected to perfectly map from 'แบบยุโรป' to the string 'European'"}, "leveraged_product_strike_level_absolute": {"type": "number", "description": "look for this \\"ราคาใช้สิทธ\\", the correspondednt number of the such as 89 is the value. so return this field with 89"}, "leveraged_product_exercise_period_end_date": {"type": "string", "description": "a date"}}, "additionalProperties": false}	Extract financial data from the Asian/Thai derivative warrant PDF term sheet. Ensure maximum data fidelity. The schema operates under an additionalProperties: false restriction. Do not invent new JSON keys.\n\n1. Non-linear reading comprehension: Financial term sheets are not read sequentially. Ingest the entire document, synthesize interrelated parameters, and construct the JSON output. Specifically, for product_description, synthesize data across multiple nodes (underlying ticker, instrument type, issuer name, maturity date) to concatenate the final string precisely.\n2. Structural nullification & The Epoch Date Artifact: The vast majority of extraneous fields (coupon generation, autocall, complex barriers) must be structural nulls. Under no circumstances should missing, blank, or structurally inapplicable data be substituted with epoch timestamps (like 1899-12-31 00:00:00) or default integers (like 0). Omitted fields must be returned as strictly null.\n3. Logic-gated mathematical string building: When evaluating the strike level fields, determine the option directionality. If Call, populate call_strike_level with the exact string concatenation of '[Quantity]*[Issue Price]' (e.g., '100000000*1.00') and leave put_strike_level null. Reverse this logic if it is a Put. Do not execute the mathematical operation. Do not insert the absolute financial strike price into these specific fields.\n4. Cross-Lingual Semantic Mapping: Execute cross-lingual semantic reasoning. Map Thai terms to English (e.g. 'สิทธิในการซื้อ' to 'Call Warrant', 'สิทธิในการขาย' to 'Put Warrant', 'แบบยุโรป' to 'European', 'ชำระเงินตามส่วนต่างของราคา' to 'Cash').\n5. Ticker Normalization: Isolate the corporate entity mentioned in the Thai text, deduce its official SET trading symbol, and construct the correct Bloomberg syntax by appending " TB Equity" to underlying_ticker.\n6. Chronological Milestones: All localized Thai Buddhist Era (BE) dates and Thai months must be mathematically converted and normalized into the universal DD/MM/YYYY or YYYY-MM-DD string format.	[]	[]	f	85	majority	docling	f	f	f	f	128k	gpt-4o	2026-04-21 16:20:17.225787	2026-04-24 06:18:42.58405
