028, 02/02/2028, 02/03/2028, 03/04/2028, 02/05/2028, 02/06/2028, 03/07/2028\\n\\n## Intended Retail Investor\\n\\nThe product is aimed at investors who:\\n\\n- Have specific knowledge or experience of investing in similar products and in financial markets, and have the ability to understand the product and its risks and rewards.\\n- Seek a product offering income and have an investment horizon in line with the recommended holding period stated below.\\n- Are able to bear total loss of their investment and accept the risk that the Issuer and / or Guarantor could fail to pay the capital and any potential return.\\n- Are willing to accept a level of risk to achieve potential returns that is consistent with the summary risk indicator shown below.\\n\\n## WHAT ARE THE RISKS AND WHAT COULD I GET IN RETURN?\\n\\nSummary Risk Indicator\\n\\nLower risk\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n<!-- image -->\\n\\n\\n\\n<!-- image -->\\n\\n\\n\\n<!-- image -->\\n\\n\\n\\n<!-- image -->\\n\\n\\n\\n<!-- image -->\\n\\n\\n\\nThe risk indicator assumes you keep the product for 2 years 5 months 9 days.\\n\\nThe actual risk can vary significantly if you cash in at an early stage and you may get back less. You may not be able to sell your product easily or you may have to sell at a price that significantly impacts on how much you get back.\\n\\n<!-- image -->\\n\\nThe summary risk indicator is a guide to the level of risk of this product compared to other products. It shows how likely it is that the product will lose money because of movements in the markets or because we are not able to pay you.\\n\\nWe have classified this product as 5 out of 7, which is a medium-high risk class.\\n\\nThis rates the potential losses from future performance at a medium-high level, and poor market conditions are very unlikely to impact our capacity to pay you.\\n\\nThis product does not include any protection from future market performance so you could lose some or all of your investment.\\n\\nIf we are not abl